{"items":[{"id":"803381169","root":"803381169","user":{"id":"253094","name":"大马烈•口帕","avatar":"5691af4a498789d37828bee5"},"text":"去网吧吧[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1750356954479,"floor":14,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381167","root":"803381167","user":{"id":"744414","name":"森绮已","avatar":"83b8b41bf725bb2537b47f81"},"text":"啊？","time":1750356911502,"floor":13,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381100","root":"803381100","user":{"id":"576056","name":"Canvas777","avatar":"6953050732108bbf8cae6a22"},"text":"啊？ ","time":1750355875114,"floor":12,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381094","root":"803381094","user":{"id":"1388277","name":"瓦是笨蛋吐","avatar":"d37d9ec2d9ee5e5ede294635"},"text":"手机和运营商通话要录音了，可以夸克网盘测试一下上传速度，准备一下，要要投诉，（不是光纤硬件的问题）师傅是解决不了，可以试探性问一下这个账户是不是黑名单了（上传过多被划分到黑名单了）。可以说明我个人正常使用并没有什么违法行为设备请按合同签约的速度提供应该有的服务。再来就是工信部申诉，主要先套到证据，还有自己这边电脑测试下来截图证明。听说有集体诉讼，师傅测速可以录像（一般师傅都会测试那些正常的测速平台，所以速度正常）。","time":1750355806843,"floor":11,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381074","root":"803381074","user":{"id":"609718","name":"灵异","avatar":"b8fa0825165d24fe6e85b8cf"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1773/]没办法，没办法管控上传流量是用来做什么，所以都是一刀切只要上传下载流量达到一定的流量、比例。都当作是pcdn统一限速。\n毕竟以前上传本身是不限制的，但是现在很多网站把规则给玩坏了，只能统一限制让你买商用宽带。","time":1750355408083,"floor":8,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381062","root":"803381062","user":{"id":"212734","name":"乱来的又不是我","avatar":"87851f45256b0db667920901"},"text":"最近sydra师傅也没传录像，爱咔又不好手机摸鱼，我上班没水真是要死了！","time":1750355241370,"floor":7,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":4,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"803381064","root":"803381062","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"华为手机可以访问[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1750355292249,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381260","root":"803381062","user":{"id":"212734","name":"乱来的又不是我","avatar":"87851f45256b0db667920901"},"text":"哼，你就抱着华为过日子吧[emot=acfun,2769/]","time":1750359278883,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381317","root":"803381062","user":{"id":"302714","name":"美索布达","avatar":"fb2296f129e9519504b59485"},"text":"爱咔吧，我最近都是看爱咔的，以前都是从sydra师傅那边下录像","time":1750361303989,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"803381057","root":"803381057","user":{"id":"13674594","name":"无赫赫之功de钟馗鰕虎鱼","avatar":"424f18a2a23b81aa95cc4fc8"},"text":"最近运营商为了pdcn杀疯了，直接投诉，看看当时签的协议是多少上传的","time":1750355175544,"floor":6,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381055","root":"803381055","user":{"id":"203846","name":"不言放弃","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"作为一个有过相关行业从业经验的肥肥，这种情况建议第一次处理无果之后直接往工信部走，不然很容易陷入无穷无尽的扯皮结果就是被耗干耐心","time":1750355168481,"floor":5,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381028","root":"803381028","user":{"id":"3587737","name":"小小丶大坏蛋","avatar":"c2465479ae9824cdf8dcb611"},"text":"师傅上门解决不了的，通常的说辞都是“这是市公司限的，我们也没办法”巴拉巴拉\n不过他们好像可以提交申请，好像就是要个流量图什么的，然后他们传到上属公司审核","time":1750354927185,"floor":4,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":4,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"803381038","root":"803381028","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"是的，所以如果解决不了，我也决定降本增效，降套餐[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1750355010666,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381047","root":"803381028","user":{"id":"3587737","name":"小小丶大坏蛋","avatar":"c2465479ae9824cdf8dcb611"},"text":"但是，讲道理还是通信公司自己的问题\n合同上给了多大带宽我用多大带宽，莫名其妙给限速就是找事","time":1750355048538,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381051","root":"803381028","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"先看吧，我看见好多投诉到工信部也解决不了的案例","time":1750355083376,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"小小丶大坏蛋","replyToUserId":"3587737","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"803381022","root":"803381022","user":{"id":"30656494","name":"何欢何来","avatar":"65abef69206f9ae216c07d32"},"text":"pcdn限制是不是能通过多多下载东西来缓解？","time":1750354871306,"floor":3,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[]},{"id":"803381020","root":"803381020","user":{"id":"1388277","name":"瓦是笨蛋吐","avatar":"d37d9ec2d9ee5e5ede294635"},"text":"原来水姐是中招了。拿起法律途径，这是正常使用，一般上传有2M左右。300kb应该是被限制。测速平台的端口测速都是正常的，就是上传都限速了。","time":1750354837093,"floor":2,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"803381005","root":"803381005","user":{"id":"509259","name":"秋田役","avatar":"42e1ae9f532a71e42ab9e11d"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1711/][emot=acfun,1711/][emot=acfun,1711/]","time":1750354675260,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedRe